{"apk":"https://f-droid.org/repo/com.crest247.flickarraykeyboard_10003.apk","category":"أدوات النظام","description":"Flick行列輸入法 是一個 100% 使用 Kotlin 與 Jetpack Compose 開發的現代化Android輸入法。 靈感源自於 Flick日語輸入法 以及 行列10 輸入法。行列10輸入法雖然按鍵少，但是每個字拆解出來的字根碼數量，很多都比行列30多了很多，而行列30的字根碼帶有上(^)、中(-)、下(v)的元素，正好也能對應成flick拖曳的方向，因而設計出了這一款輸入法。 核心特色 Flick行列模式 ：創新的 行列30 輸入方式，為本專案的核心主軸，將行列30傳統字根中的上、中、下元素，直覺地映射至觸控螢幕的flick拖曳操作。專為手機窄螢幕配置設計。 特殊功能鍵與D-Pad ： D-Pad ：在數個輸入模式中","developer_group":null,"generated":"2026-11-26T17:57:50Z","id":"com.crest247.flickarraykeyboard","kind":"baked","latest_sha256":"1ce4f730ce00439741dac25d58d0519ea90740eecafaf2be70ecf53ae9e133b1","latest_size":1336618,"latest_version":"1.0.3","license":"MIT","name":"Flick行列輸入法","page":"https://ibra8y3-web.github.io/kanz-catalog/a/com-crest247-flickarraykeyboard-513dc2/","qr_png":"https://ibra8y3-web.github.io/kanz-catalog/a/com-crest247-flickarraykeyboard-513dc2/qr.png","screenshots":["https://ibra8y3-web.github.io/kanz-catalog/shots/com-crest247-flickarraykeyboard-513dc2/1.webp","https://ibra8y3-web.github.io/kanz-catalog/shots/com-crest247-flickarraykeyboard-513dc2/2.webp"],"slug":"com-crest247-flickarraykeyboard-513dc2","source_url":"https://f-droid.org/packages/com.crest247.flickarraykeyboard/","updated":"2026-10-25","versions":[{"date":"2026-10-25","file":"com.crest247.flickarraykeyboard_10003.apk","prerelease":false,"removed_upstream":false,"sha256":"1ce4f730ce00439741dac25d58d0519ea90740eecafaf2be70ecf53ae9e133b1","size":1336618,"url":"https://f-droid.org/repo/com.crest247.flickarraykeyboard_10003.apk","version":"1.0.3"}]}